<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl#groundedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a TacitLesson or SourceDomain to its grounding concept in Wikidata (range is external, e.g. wd:Q...). Matches the spreadsheet's 'Tacit Lesson URI' and 'Literal Image URI' columns. No rdfs:range is declared deliberately: the value is a Wikidata entity outside this ontology's own classes, so constraining it to one of our classes would be incorrect. This omission is intentional, not an oversight."@en .
<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl#groundedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl> .
<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl#groundedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "grounded in (Wikidata)"@en .
<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl#groundedIn> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Bear grounded in wd:Q30090244" .
