<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl#hasEquivalenceType> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty> .
<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl#hasEquivalenceType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl#CrossCulturalEquivalence> .
<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl#hasEquivalenceType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl#EquivalenceType> .
<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl#hasEquivalenceType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Classifies a cross-cultural equivalence with one of the four equivalence types. Functional: one equivalence link has exactly one equivalence type. Combined with the AllDifferent axiom on the four types below, this is what lets the reasoner catch a link accidentally assigned two different types."@en .
<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl#hasEquivalenceType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl> .
<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl#hasEquivalenceType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has equivalence type"@en .
<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl#hasEquivalenceType> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example> "Equiv_PRV-012_PRV-025 has equivalence type DirectMatch" .
