<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl#hasSourceDomain> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl> .
