<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl#linksProverbA> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links a cross-cultural equivalence to the first of the two proverbs it connects; the generated data puts the lower proverb ID here, and the order carries no meaning. Functional: one equivalence link points to exactly one proverb as its 'A' side."@en .
<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl#linksProverbA> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl> .
