<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl#FalseFriend> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The two proverbs share an image but teach different lessons."@en .
<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl#FalseFriend> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl> .
<https://raw.githubusercontent.com/callmesevda/KR-Project/main/proto-ontology-structure.ttl#FalseFriend> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "False friend (same image, different lesson)"@en .
